CORE
main.cpp
--cpp17
^\[main\.assertion\.1\] .* declval<void>: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.2\] .* declval<S> is S&&: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.3\] .* declval<S&>: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.4\] .* member call on declval: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.5\] .* reference to void is a substitution failure: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.6\] .* int picks the int overload: SUCCESS$
^\[main\.assertion\.7\] .* WRONG \(must FAIL\): FAILURE$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
--
^warning: ignoring
^CONVERSION ERROR$
--
g++ 13 (-fsanitize=address,undefined) and clang++ 18 accept this program,
and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
